---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service — FixLanka Tools"
  description="Terms and conditions for utilizing FixLanka Tools free online utilities."
  canonicalUrl="https://fixlanka.com/terms"
>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 sm:py-16 space-y-8">
    <header class="space-y-3">
      <span class="text-xs font-semibold px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/15 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/30">
        Terms & Conditions
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">
        Terms of Service
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">
        Last Updated: November 2026
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="space-y-6 text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
      <section class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-dark-card border border-dark-border space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>
          By accessing or using FixLanka Tools (<a href="https://fixlanka.com" class="text-emerald-400 underline">https://fixlanka.com</a>), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree to these terms, please discontinue use of the platform.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">2. Permitted Use</h2>
        <p>
          FixLanka Tools is provided free of charge for personal, educational, and commercial purposes. You agree not to use the utilities for:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-xs text-slate-400">
          <li>Unlawful activities, including distribution of malware, malicious scripts, or prohibited materials.</li>
          <li>Attempting to attack, disable, or overwhelm the static infrastructure via denial-of-service attempts.</li>
          <li>Engaging in deceptive practices such as forging digital evidence or falsifying provenance information.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">3. Disclaimers & Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          The services are provided on an "AS IS" and "AS AVAILABLE" basis without warranties of any kind. While our tools undergo rigorous testing, FixLanka Tools cannot guarantee that output files will always be error-free or that client-side memory limitations on older mobile devices will not interrupt heavy operations.
        </p>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">
          You are solely responsible for verifying the integrity of your output documents and maintaining backup copies of all original files before processing.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">4. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>
          You retain 100% of the intellectual property rights to any images, texts, or documents you process through FixLanka Tools. We claim zero ownership or rights over your generated outputs.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">5. Governing Law</h2>
        <p>
          These Terms of Service are governed by general principles of international commercial and electronic law.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
